BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lift-20261002@training-tracker
DTSTAMP:20261002T111736Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261002T163000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261002T174000
SUMMARY:Session C\, week 1
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: Ramp in. Stop every set with 3 reps left. Week 1 is 2 s
 ets\, 3 sets from week 2.\n\nWarm up: Wall walk out 2 x 10 sec\; Band shou
 lder exercise\, 2 sets\; Standing row 2.5 kg\, 1 x 10 with 6 sec hold\; Ba
 nd hip abduction\, 3 steps each side x 2\; Table top leg extensions\, 1 se
 t to fatigue\; Ramp up set at half your working weight\n\nDB reverse lunge
  or step up: 2 x 8-12 each\nChest supported 2 arm DB row: 2 x 8-12\nPush u
 p (feet up or standard): 2 x 6-15 *\nBent over reverse fly: 2 x 12-20\nDB 
 curl (superset): 2 x 10-15 *\nOverhead tricep extension (superset): 2 x 10
 -15 *\nSuitcase carry or side plank: 2 x 30-45 sec each\n\n* upper body pr
 iority (4 sets in weeks 7 to 11)\nLog every set in the Training app. Tap H
 ow to do it on any exercise for steps and videos.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Session C\, week 1
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
